tedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1377947-heirs-to-the-shogunate-backers-preview-just-dropped?p=1382051#post1382051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So both Ragara and Ledaal rose as Houses out of the same event?<br /> <br /> Is this previous edition info? Or did I miss it in the Realm?</div> </div> </div> </div>Naw, there different Houses<br /> <br /> The earlier Jerah<br /> <br /> And the later Jurul","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-16T21:01:38-07:00","id":1382055,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1377947-heirs-to-the-shogunate-backers-preview-just-dropped?p=1382051#post1382051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So both Ragara and Ledaal rose as Houses out of the same event?<br /> <br /> Is this previous edition info? Or did I miss it in the Realm?</div> </div> </div> </div>They're separate but similarly-shaped events.<br /> <br /> Ragara supplanted Jerah because it was using Eyem (a malicious automota/AI-thing) in RY 168. (He was 29 at the time, to kind of show how like, impressive that was.)<br /> <br /> Ledaal supplanted Jurul, which was compromised by a Lunar Anathema. This happened in RY 462, a good near three centuries later.<br /> <br /> This is detailed for both in <b>What Fire Has Wrought</b> under the house's respective histories and founding. Dates are from the timeline in <b>The Realm</b>, which also points out the events.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-16T21:57:32-07:00","id":1382061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iceblade44</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1377947-heirs-to-the-shogunate-backers-preview-just-dropped?p=1382053#post1382053\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Naw, there different Houses<br /> <br /> The earlier Jerah<br /> <br /> And the later Jurul</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay in Glamour's defense I've mixed up names that were less similar. :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-17T00:12:26-07:00","id":1382075,"title":"","content":"Yeah, they are similar-sounding. And both were involved in dodgy stuff.<br /> <br /> (House Jerah and Eyem is a thing that was in 1st ed, IIRC, while Jurul is new)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-17T00:13:39-07:00","id":1382076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1377947-heirs-to-the-shogunate-backers-preview-just-dropped?p=1382047#post1382047\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I came up with that for the wings\u2019 background tying them now to V\u2019neef.<br /> <br /> My thinking is that after everyone actually implicated in Jurul\u2019s conspiracy had been executed or fled, and Jurul Ledaal\u2019s household was elevated to House Ledaal, those fellow Jurul whose loyalty was beyond question and willing to swear to Ledaal\u2019s Shadow Crusade were adopted into her new House. Those households that weren\u2019t implicated in treason but for whatever reason didn\u2019t reach Ledaal\u2019s standards were demoted to Patrician houses when Jurul was striken (I\u2019m sure there was a small rush to adopt newly Patrician DBs into their fathers\u2019 Houses, but the mortal ex-Dynasts were shit out of luck.)<br /> <br /> One of those DB-producing Patrician lines was one of the founding adopted families of House V\u2019neef centuries later.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that makes sense. Good stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-17T00:32:52-07:00","id":1382078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1377947-heirs-to-the-shogunate-backers-preview-just-dropped?p=1381997#post1381997\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ragara exposed the trechery of House Jerah and what was left of them was folded into his House.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given everything else Ragara has gotten up to and the way the timeline sets that up, I honestly find that very suspicious. It would not surprise me one bit to discover that Ragara framed them up and down in order to get his own house. Or that he was behind them getting Eyem. Or that Eyem is now in HIS basement giving him solid financial advice, because he cooked the books so everyone would think it was an evil mastermind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":226,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","user":"BrilliantRain","date":". 04-17-2020, 03:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-17T00:36:29-07:00","id":1382080,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1377947-heirs-to-the-shogunate-backers-preview-just-dropped?p=1382078#post1382078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Given everything else Ragara has gotten up to and the way the timeline sets that up, I honestly find that very suspicious. It would not surprise me one bit to discover that Ragara framed them up and down in order to get his own house.